OL,3,GNEWSAPricey car parks still losing     
OL,4,Acouncil money                          
OL,6,FA local authority with some of the     
OL,7,Fhighest parking prices in its region is
OL,8,Flosing hundreds of thousands of pounds 
OL,9,Fon the service as maintenance costs    
OL,10,Foutstrip income.                       
OL,12,FRedcar and Cleveland Council said it   
OL,13,Fraised #1.575m from parking in the last
OL,14,Ffinancial year, but spent #1.821m.     
OL,16,FThe resulting shortfall of #246,000 is 
OL,17,Fmore than double the loss in the       
OL,18,Fprevious year despite some parking -   
OL,19,Fespecially long stay - in the borough  
OL,20,Fbeing more expensive than at other     
OL,21,FTeesside locations.                    
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
