OL,3,GNEWSAPricey car parks still losing     
OL,4,Acouncil money                          
OL,6,FAssistant director of neighbourhoods   
OL,7,FRob Hoof told a scrutiny committee     
OL,8,Fcharges needed to be affordable, but   
OL,9,Fadmitted Redcar was "at the upper end  
OL,10,Fof rates within the Tees Valley".      
